<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady</p>
<p>to $0.25lower. Trade moderate. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     58.50-59.00, mostly 59.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     58.00-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     56.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows:  mostly steady, instances 0.50 higher on a very thin test.</p>
<p>Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs	47.50</p>
<p>	   500-700 lbs	48.00</p>
</text>
